[I] Systemd unit generator for zram devices

[T] zram-generator is a systemd generator that provides a simple and fast
[T] mechanism to configure swap, or devices with a file system, on /dev/zram
[T] compressed RAM block devices, based on the zram-generator.conf
[T] configuration file.

[U] https://github.com/systemd/zram-generator

[A] systemd
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS
[R] - alpha arc avr32 blackfin cris hppa hppa64 i860 m68k microblaze nios2 openrisc superh

[L] MIT
[V] 1.2.1

[D] 54a3b8bc32646d57e0cc947aec504d7a6c1d15b7c521dff22b7b276f zram-generator-1.2.1.tar.gz https://github.com/systemd/zram-generator/archive/v1.2.1/

runconf=0 runcargo=0

makeopt="DESTDIR=$root"
makeinstopt="DESTDIR=$root install"
